libcoraza (1.8.0-0keel1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * First Keel package (handbook decision 0041, first implementation,
    step 5): the C library the Nginx connector of Coraza loads. Not in
    Debian and no ITP. Built offline from the upstream release tarball and
    a vendor component tarball of its Go modules (debian/README.source).
  * Built with golang-1.26-go from trixie-backports: Coraza 3.7 requires
    Go 1.25 and libcoraza 1.8.0 Go 1.26, and trixie's golang-go is 1.24.
  * The soname is libcoraza.so.1, set at link time; upstream builds an
    unversioned libcoraza.so. The static archive is not shipped, since
    nothing in Keel links it.

 -- Marcos Mendez <mendez.foto@gmail.com>  Thu, 01 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
